    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a temporary break. i don't think i'm looking for a \"space to heal.\" i feel like i'm just looking for an end to the cycle. like, if the world is never going to change and i'm never going to fit, why do i have to keep going through this every single day? it just feels like a lot of wasted energy.",
